OL,3,CFrance and Spain race to control
OL,4,Cwildfires which have forced 250,000 to
OL,5,Cevacuate
OL,7,FSeveral large wildfires remained 'out
OL,8,Fof control' across Europe on Saturday,
OL,9,Fwith firefighters battling to contain
OL,10,Fthem, as ITV News' Jay Akbar reports
OL,12,FFrance and Spain have evacuated tens
OL,13,Fof thousands of people near the cities
OL,14,Fof Bordeaux and Madrid, as
OL,15,Ffirefighters battle the worst forest
OL,16,Ffires on record in both regions.
OL,18,FFrench President Emmanuel Macron has
OL,19,Fmobilised the army amid fears that the
OL,20,Ffire will reach Bordeaux.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
