OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785071911
OL,3,CFrance and Spain race to control
OL,4,Cwildfires which have forced 250,000 to
OL,5,Cevacuate
OL,7,FIn Spain, firefighters are hoping to
OL,8,Fgain control of the blaze, but wind
OL,9,Fthreatens to fan the flames further.
OL,11,FFrancisco Martin, a government
OL,12,Fdelegate in Madrid said: "In terms of
OL,13,Ffigures, we are talking about around
OL,14,F20,000 hectares in the Madrid region
OL,15,Fthat are currently affected by the
OL,16,Ffire. This is undoubtedly the largest
OL,17,Ffire in the history of the Madrid
OL,18,Fregion."
OL,26,@tD@ZOUzD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
