OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785071911
OL,3,CFrance and Spain race to control
OL,4,Cwildfires which have forced 250,000 to
OL,5,Cevacuate
OL,7,FFrance was preparing to use a massive
OL,8,Fspecially adapted cargo aircraft to
OL,9,Fdump flame retardants on a wildfire
OL,10,Fthat was threatening the suburbs of
OL,11,Fthe wine region city of Bordeaux.
OL,13,FFrench Interior Minister Laurent Nunez
OL,14,Fsaid the hulking A400M aircraft will
OL,15,Fjoin 18 other water- and retardant-
OL,16,Fdropping planes and helicopters waging
OL,17,Fan expected "long and very difficult"
OL,18,Fbattle against the blaze raging in the
OL,19,FGironde region of southwestern France.
OL,26,@yD@MOUyD@eO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785071911
OL,3,CFrance and Spain race to control
OL,4,Cwildfires which have forced 250,000 to
OL,5,Cevacuate
OL,7,FWith winds expected to shift in a west-
OL,8,Fto-east direction on Saturday
OL,9,Fafternoon, potentially driving the
OL,10,Ffire closer to Bordeaux, fire crews
OL,11,Fand authorities were digging trenches,
OL,12,Fusing retardants and taking other
OL,13,Fsteps to block it, Nunez said. He said
OL,14,Fthe fire was about 30 kilometers (20
OL,15,Fmiles) west of the city and lost some
OL,16,Fof its intensity overnight.
OL,18,FThe government mobilized soldiers to
OL,19,Fjoin the battle and was rushing in 1.5
OL,20,Fmillion face masks to protect against
OL,21,Fchoking smoke.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
