OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785071911
OL,3,CFrance and Spain race to control
OL,4,Cwildfires which have forced 250,000 to
OL,5,Cevacuate
OL,7,FAuthorities ordered people between the
OL,8,Ffire and Bordeaux to evacuate,
OL,9,Fincluding from parts of the city's
OL,10,Fwestern suburbs and other towns and
OL,11,Fvillages.
OL,13,FFrench Prime Minister Sebastien
OL,14,FLecornu described the fires as
OL,15,Funprecedented and said the Gironde
OL,16,Fblaze became so strong on Friday that
OL,17,Fit had begun generating its own winds.
OL,26,@uD@Xrr
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
