OL,3,CFrance and Spain race to control
OL,4,Cwildfires which have forced 250,000 to
OL,5,Cevacuate
OL,7,F"Our priority is clear: protecting
OL,8,Fhuman lives," he posted on X, adding
OL,9,Fthat evacuation orders "must be
OL,10,Frespected without delay."
OL,12,FFirefighters in Spain said the blazes
OL,13,Fspread so fast and violently that they
OL,14,Fcould not be tackled head on. In
OL,15,FFrance, some people even fled by boat
OL,16,Fwhen flames swept through touristic
OL,17,Ftowns on the Atlantic coast.
OL,26,@oD@AOUpD@MO]qD@XOUrD@YO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
