CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785071911
OL,3,CFrance and Spain race to control
OL,4,Cwildfires which have forced 250,000 to
OL,5,Cevacuate
OL,7,FDozens of French firefighters have
OL,8,Fbeen injured, authorities said, but no
OL,9,Fdeaths were reported in either country
OL,10,Fdespite the scenes of panic as
OL,11,Ftownsfolk fled by car and police went
OL,12,Fdoor to door to tell people to leave
OL,13,Fas large plumes of smoke darkened the
OL,14,Fskies.
OL,16,FMore than 250,000 people have already
OL,17,Fbeen evacuated by this week's fires.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
