PN,31408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785071911
OL,3,CFrance and Spain race to control
OL,4,Cwildfires which have forced 250,000 to
OL,5,Cevacuate
OL,7,FSuccessive heat waves that hit
OL,8,Funusually early and hard this year,
OL,9,Fbaking Europe with record-shattering
OL,10,Fhigh temperatures, have turned forests
OL,11,Fand scrublands into tinderboxes.
OL,13,FThe virulence of the wildfires, fueled
OL,14,Fby high temperatures and the long-term
OL,15,Feffects of climate change, caught fire
OL,16,Fcrews and authorities off guard in
OL,17,Fboth countries.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
