OL,3,CFrance and Spain race to control
OL,4,Cwildfires which have forced 250,000 to
OL,5,Cevacuate
OL,7,FSubscribe free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,FFires have burned 130,000 hectares of
OL,13,Fforest already this year in Spain, up
OL,14,Ffrom an annual average of 100,000
OL,15,Fhectares over the past decade, Sanchez
OL,16,Fsaid on Saturday as he visited a
OL,17,Fcommand post west of Madrid.
OL,26,@wD@arp
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/10
