FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31410
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785071911
OL,3,CFrance and Spain race to control
OL,4,Cwildfires which have forced 250,000 to
OL,5,Cevacuate
OL,7,FHe said more favorable weather
OL,8,FSaturday offered "a window of
OL,9,Fopportunity" for fire crews to bring
OL,10,Fthe blazes under control. Madrid's
OL,11,Fregional government said the fires
OL,12,Fdecreased in intensity as winds and
OL,13,Ftemperatures dropped.
OL,15,FOther European nations were helping,
OL,16,Fwith Italy, Greece, the Netherlands,
OL,17,FPortugal, Croatia, the Czech Republic
OL,18,Fand Slovakia already providing or
OL,19,Fexpected to deploy water-dumping
OL,20,Fplanes and helicopters to the Spanish
OL,21,Fand French fire fronts.
OL,26,@pD@ROUqD@LO]
